hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16168","Ali ibn Thabit narrated to us, he said: Abd al-Hamid ibn Jafar al-Ansari narrated to me, from his father, from Ilba al-Sulami, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) says: The Hour will not rise except upon the vilest of people."
